msgstr "您没有权限查看此页面。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:154
#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:302
#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:841
msgid "Copied"
msgstr "已复制"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:155
#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:842
msgid "Copy failed"
msgstr "复制失败"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:158
msgid "Connect this WordPress site to OpenClaw or other local AI clients."
msgstr "将此 WordPress 站点连接到 OpenClaw 或其他本地 AI 客户端。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:162
#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:690
#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:1216
msgid "Status"
msgstr "状态"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:166
msgid "Site"
msgstr "站点"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:170
#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:228
msgid "Active devices"
msgstr "有效设备"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:177
msgid "Suite dependencies need attention."
msgstr "套件依赖需要处理。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:192
msgid "Boundary hygiene."
msgstr "边界卫生。"

#. translators: %d: number of active application passwords.
#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:197
#, php-format
msgid ""
"You have %d active WordPress Application Password while paired device keys "
"are available."
msgid_plural ""
"You have %d active WordPress Application Passwords while paired device keys "
"are available."
msgstr[0] ""
"在已配对设备密钥可用的情况下，您仍有 %d 个处于激活状态的 WordPress 应用密码。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:202
msgid ""
"Application Password connections are conventional boundaries; review and "
"revoke unused ones."
msgstr "应用密码连接只是约定边界；请检查并撤销不再使用的应用密码。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:203
msgid "Open profile passwords"
msgstr "打开个人资料密码页"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:213
msgid "Secure key pairing"
msgstr "安全密钥配对"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:214
msgid "Recommended"
msgstr "推荐"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:216
msgid ""
"Recommended path: pair a local signed key so the client never receives a "
"WordPress Application Password."
msgstr "推荐路径：配对本地签名密钥，避免客户端接收 WordPress 应用密码。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:221
msgid "Copy connect command"
msgstr "复制连接命令"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:222
msgid "Manage devices"
msgstr "管理设备"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:224
msgid ""
"Run this command on the computer or terminal where OpenClaw is running. "
"Adapter stores only the approved public key."
msgstr ""
"请在运行 OpenClaw 的电脑或终端中运行该命令。Adapter 只保存已批准的公钥。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:233
msgid ""
"Revoke a device when it is no longer used or was approved by mistake. "
"Revoked devices must pair again before they can connect."
msgstr "设备不再使用或误授权时可撤销。撤销后的设备必须重新配对才能连接。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:240
msgid "Fallback: WordPress Application Password connection"
msgstr "备用：WordPress 应用密码连接"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:241
msgid ""
"Use only when the client has a dedicated secret field. This is a "
"conventional boundary: the password can reach WordPress REST directly, so "
"the approval gate is voluntary for that client."
msgstr ""
"仅在客户端拥有专用密钥字段时使用。这是一种约定边界：该密码可以直接访问 "
"WordPress REST，因此审批门禁对该客户端属于自愿性质。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:249
msgid "Application name"
msgstr "应用名称"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:255
msgid "Include LocalWP TLS setting"
msgstr "包含 LocalWP TLS 设置"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:257
msgid "LocalWP TLS option. Use only for localhost or .local testing."
msgstr "LocalWP TLS 选项。仅用于 localhost 或 .local 测试。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:262
msgid ""
"I understand this fallback creates a WordPress Application Password and the "
"signed key-pair connection is preferred because only a paired key is an "
"enforced boundary."
msgstr ""
"我理解此备用方式会创建一个 WordPress 应用密码；推荐使用签名密钥对连接，因为只"
"有已配对的密钥才处于受强制的边界内。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:267
msgid "Create Application Password connection"
msgstr "创建应用密码连接"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:274
msgid "The password is shown once. Store it only in the client secret field."
msgstr "密码只显示一次。请只保存到客户端密钥字段。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:290
#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:438
msgid "You do not have permission to approve device pairing."
msgstr "您没有权限批准设备配对。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:305
msgid "Device pairing code was not found or has expired."
msgstr "设备配对码不存在或已过期。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:309
msgid "Connection approved."
msgstr "连接已批准。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:310
msgid ""
"Return to the terminal or local AI client that started pairing. Wait for it "
"to report ready; this browser page can be closed. Adapter stores only the "
"public key; the private key was never sent to WordPress."
msgstr ""
"请返回发起配对的终端或本地 AI 客户端。等待它显示 ready；此浏览器页面可以关"
"闭。适配器只保存公钥；私钥从未发送到 WordPress。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:312
msgid ""
"If you did not start this pairing, revoke this client from the Adapter page "
"immediately."
msgstr "如果您没有发起此次配对，请立即在适配器页面撤销此客户端。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:312
msgid "Manage paired clients"
msgstr "管理已配对客户端"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:315
msgid "Connection rejected."
msgstr "连接已拒绝。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:316
msgid ""
"Return to the terminal or local AI client. The client will stop polling with "
"a rejected status."
msgstr "请返回终端或本地 AI 客户端。客户端会以已拒绝状态停止轮询。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:319
msgid ""
"Approve this local AI client only if you initiated the connection. Adapter "
"stores only the public key; the private key stays on your computer."
msgstr ""
"只有在您主动发起连接时才批准此本地 AI 客户端。适配器只保存公钥；私钥保留在您"
"的电脑上。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:324
#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:368
msgid "Device note"
msgstr "设备备注"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:326
msgid "Client"
msgstr "客户端"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:327
msgid "Device reported by client"
msgstr "客户端报告的设备"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:328
msgid "Local verifier"
msgstr "本地验证程序"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:329
msgid "User code"
msgstr "用户代码"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:329
msgid "Used pairing code"
msgstr "已使用的配对代码"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:330
msgid "Started"
msgstr "发起时间"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:332
msgid "Approved"
msgstr "批准时间"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:335
msgid "Expires"
msgstr "过期时间"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:340
msgid "Approved access"
msgstr "已批准的访问权限"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:340
msgid "Requested access"
msgstr "请求的访问权限"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:346
msgid ""
"This approval does not grant direct WordPress write, approval, publish, "
"provider credential, prompt, model routing, or production workload execution "
"authority. Writes must still go through Core proposal, approval, and commit-"
"preflight; Adapter remains the client channel."
msgstr ""
"此批准不会授予直接 WordPress 写入、审批、发布、提供商凭据、提示词、模型路由或"
"生产工作负载执行权限。写入仍必须经过 Core 提案、审批和提交预检；Adapter 仍然"
"只是客户端通道。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:350
msgid "Diagnostic details"
msgstr "诊断详情"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:351
msgid "IDs and fingerprints for support; these are not client setup secrets."
msgstr "用于支持排查的 ID 和指纹；这些不是客户端配置密钥。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:353
msgid ""
"Do not paste these values into chat, tool commands, proposal payloads, or "
"setup text unless a support workflow explicitly asks for diagnostic "
"identifiers."
msgstr ""
"除非支持流程明确要求诊断标识符，否则不要把这些值粘贴到聊天、工具命令、提案负"
"载或配置文本中。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:356
msgid "Public key fingerprint"
msgstr "公钥指纹"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:357
msgid "Scope IDs"
msgstr "权限范围 ID"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:359
msgid "Connection record ID"
msgstr "连接记录 ID"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:360
msgid "Client key record ID"
msgstr "客户端密钥记录 ID"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:369
msgid "Example: Muze MacBook or office OpenClaw"
msgstr "例如：Muze MacBook 或办公室 OpenClaw"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:370
msgid ""
"Optional administrator-only label for later management. It is not used for "
"authentication or authorization. Do not enter passwords, tokens, private "
"keys, or local file paths."
msgstr ""
"可选，仅供管理员后续管理识别。它不参与认证或授权。不要填写密码、令牌、私钥或"
"本地文件路径。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:375
msgid "Approve connection"
msgstr "批准连接"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:376
msgid "Reject"
msgstr "拒绝"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:392
msgid "Npcink client approved"
msgstr "Npcink 客户端已批准"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:396
msgid "Npcink client rejected"
msgstr "Npcink 客户端已拒绝"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:410
msgid "Read approved Adapter and WordPress Abilities API routes."
msgstr "读取已批准的 Adapter 和 WordPress Abilities API 路由。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:411
msgid "Create Core-governed proposals for reviewed writes."
msgstr "为已审核的写入创建由 Core 治理的提案。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:412
msgid "Check Adapter, Core proposal, and execution status."
msgstr "检查 Adapter、Core 提案和执行状态。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:413
msgid ""
"Execute already-approved Adapter write routes after human approval in the "
"Core admin and commit preflight. This scope never includes proposal "
"approval: the client cannot approve its own proposals."
msgstr ""
"在治理核心后台人工批准并完成提交预检后，执行已获批准的适配器写入路由。此作用"
"域绝不包含提案审批：客户端不能批准自己的提案。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:425
msgid "No recognized Adapter scopes were requested."
msgstr "未请求可识别的 Adapter 权限范围。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:478
msgid "You do not have permission to revoke client keys."
msgstr "您没有权限撤销客户端密钥。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:500
msgid "You do not have permission to create AI client handoff credentials."
msgstr "您没有权限创建 OpenClaw 交接凭据。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:506
#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:926
msgid "Application Password fallback is disabled for this environment."
msgstr "当前环境已禁用应用密码备用连接。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:512
msgid ""
"Confirm that you understand this fallback creates a WordPress Application "
"Password."
msgstr "请确认您理解此备用方式会创建 WordPress 应用密码。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:589
msgid "Dependency contracts need attention."
msgstr "依赖契约需要处理。"

#. translators: %s: dependency label.
#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:612
#, php-format
msgid "%s is not reachable for a contract check."
msgstr "%s 无法访问，无法进行契约检查。"

#. translators: 1: dependency label, 2: detected version, 3: required version.
#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:619
#, php-format
msgid "version %2$s is older than the required %3$s."
msgstr "版本 %2$s 低于所需的 %3$s。"

#. translators: 1: dependency label, 2: detected contract version, 3: required contract version.
#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:628
#, php-format
msgid "contract version %2$s is older than the required %3$s."
msgstr "契约版本 %2$s 低于所需的 %3$s。"

#. translators: %s: dependency label.
#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:636
#, php-format
msgid "%s exposes an unsupported schema version."
msgstr "%s 暴露了不受支持的 schema 版本。"

#. translators: %s: dependency label.
#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:640
#, php-format
msgid "%s does not support the required boundary semantics."
msgstr "%s 不支持所需的边界语义。"

#. translators: %s: dependency label.
#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:648
#, php-format
msgid "%s:"
msgstr "%s："

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:667
msgid "Recent client errors"
msgstr "近期客户端错误"

#. translators: %d: number of recorded errors.
#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:673
#, php-format
msgid "%d recent Adapter channel error."
msgid_plural "%d recent Adapter channel errors."
msgstr[0] "%d 条近期适配器通道错误。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:683
msgid ""
"No recent client errors recorded. Failed Adapter requests from connected "
"clients appear here."
msgstr "暂无近期客户端错误记录。已连接客户端发送的失败适配器请求会显示在这里。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:688
msgid "Time"
msgstr "时间"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:689
msgid "Request"
msgstr "请求"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:691
msgid "Error code"
msgstr "错误码"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:706
msgid ""
"Bounded diagnostics from the Adapter channel only. Core Governance Audit "
"remains the governance log; AI Request Logs remain the provider request log."
msgstr ""
"仅包含适配器通道的有界诊断信息。Core Governance Audit 仍是治理日志；AI "
"Request Logs 仍是提供方请求日志。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:734
msgid "Unavailable"
msgstr "不可用"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:741
#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:1068
#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:1076
#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:1084
msgid "Ready"
msgstr "就绪"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:747
msgid "Needs dependencies"
msgstr "需要依赖项"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:837
#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:845
msgid "AI Client Connection Created"
msgstr "AI 客户端连接已创建"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:847
msgid ""
"Copy this Application Password now. WordPress shows it only once and stores "
"only a hash."
msgstr "请立即复制此应用密码。WordPress 只显示一次，并且只保存哈希。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:848
msgid ""
"Paste it only into the AI client dedicated secret field. Adapter does not "
"grant provider credentials, prompt management, workflow runtime, or Cloud "
"connector authority."
msgstr ""
"只将它粘贴到 AI 客户端的专用密钥字段。Adapter 不授予提供商凭据、提示词管理、"
"工作流运行时或 Cloud 连接器权限。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:851
msgid "One-time Application Password"
msgstr "一次性应用密码"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:853
msgid "Copy Application Password"
msgstr "复制应用密码"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:857
msgid "Adapter URL"
msgstr "适配器 URL"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:858
msgid "WordPress user"
msgstr "WordPress 用户"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:859
msgid "Password UUID"
msgstr "密码 UUID"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:861
msgid "Connection manifest"
msgstr "连接清单"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:862
msgid "Copy manifest"
msgstr "复制清单"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:865
msgid "AI client env placeholder"
msgstr "客户端环境变量占位符"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:866
msgid "Copy env placeholder"
msgstr "复制环境变量占位符"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:870
msgid "Back to Npcink AI Client Adapter"
msgstr "返回 Npcink AI 客户端适配器"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:929
msgid "Application Passwords are not available for this user or site."
msgstr "此用户或站点不可用应用密码。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:1068
#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:1076
#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:1084
msgid "Needs attention"
msgstr "需要处理"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:1069
msgid "Suite dependencies"
msgstr "套件依赖"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:1071
msgid "Npcink Governance Core and the Abilities Toolkit are active."
msgstr "Npcink 治理核心与能力工具包均已激活。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:1072
msgid ""
"Install or activate the missing suite plugins listed above; Adapter routes "
"fail closed without them."
msgstr ""
"请安装或启用上方列出的缺失套件插件；缺少它们时，适配器路由将一律拒绝执行。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:1077
msgid "Pair a client key"
msgstr "配对一个客户端密钥"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:1079
msgid ""
"At least one approved device key is active; this is the enforced-boundary "
"connection path."
msgstr "至少有一个已批准的设备密钥处于激活状态；这是受强制边界保护的连接路径。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:1080
msgid ""
"Copy the connect command below, run it on the machine where the AI client "
"runs, then approve the pairing request."
msgstr "复制下方的连接命令，在运行 AI 客户端的机器上执行，然后批准该配对请求。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:1085
msgid "Verify a signed request"
msgstr "验证一个签名请求"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:1087
msgid "A paired key has completed a signed Adapter request successfully."
msgstr "已配对的密钥成功完成了一次签名适配器请求。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:1088
msgid ""
"The connect command tests a signed health request after approval; this step "
"completes automatically once pairing finishes."
msgstr ""
"连接命令会在批准后测试一次签名健康检查请求；配对完成后此步骤会自动完成。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:1093
msgid "Connection readiness"
msgstr "连接就绪状态"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:1103
msgid ""
"Readiness covers the connection only. Writes still require a Core proposal, "
"human approval, and commit-preflight; approval state lives in Npcink "
"Governance Core."
msgstr ""
"就绪状态仅覆盖连接本身。写入操作仍需要治理核心提案、人工批准和提交预检；审批"
"状态保存在 Npcink 治理核心中。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:1131
msgid "No active key-pair clients"
msgstr "没有有效的密钥配对客户端"

#. translators: 1: number of active clients, 2: formatted last-used timestamp.
#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:1137
#, php-format
msgid "%1$d active, last used %2$s"
msgid_plural "%1$d active, last used %2$s"
msgstr[0] "%1$d 个有效，最近使用于 %2$s"

#. translators: %d: number of active clients.
#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:1145
#, php-format
msgid "%d active, not used yet"
msgid_plural "%d active, not used yet"
msgstr[0] "%d 个有效，尚未使用"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:1171
msgid ""
"No active key-pair clients are registered for this administrator. Run the "
"connect command, approve the browser prompt, then refresh this page."
msgstr ""
"此管理员尚无有效密钥配对客户端。请运行连接命令，批准浏览器提示，然后刷新此页"
"面。"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:1182
msgid "Revoked devices"
msgstr "已撤销设备"

#. translators: %d: number of revoked key-pair clients.
#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:1187
#, php-format
msgid "%d revoked device record"
msgid_plural "%d revoked device records"
msgstr[0] "%d 条已撤销设备记录"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:1213
msgid "Device"
msgstr "设备"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:1214
msgid "Device ID"
msgstr "设备标识"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:1215
msgid "Last used"
msgstr "上次使用"

#: includes/Admin/Connection_Page.php:1218
