#: includes/Rest/Signing_Auth.php:87
msgid ""
"Adapter requires a paired signed client or a WordPress administrator "
"session. Start key-pair device pairing, then send the signed request headers."
msgstr ""
"Adapter 需要已配对的签名客户端或 WordPress 管理员会话。请先完成密钥对设备配"
"对，再发送签名请求头。"

#: includes/Rest/Signing_Auth.php:265
msgid "Ed25519 signed requests require the PHP sodium extension."
msgstr "Ed25519 签名请求需要 PHP sodium 扩展。"

#: includes/Rest/Signing_Auth.php:282
msgid ""
"The signed request is missing required Npcink signature credential fields."
msgstr "签名请求缺少必需的 Npcink 签名凭据字段。"

#: includes/Rest/Signing_Auth.php:284
msgid ""
"Send key_id, timestamp, nonce, content_sha256, alg=Ed25519, and signature on "
"every request. See docs/keypair-device-pairing-contract.md."
msgstr ""
"每个请求都必须发送 key_id、timestamp、nonce、content_sha256、alg=Ed25519 和 "
"signature。参见 docs/keypair-device-pairing-contract.md。"

#: includes/Rest/Signing_Auth.php:293
msgid ""
"The signed request timestamp is unparseable or outside the allowed freshness "
"window."
msgstr "签名请求时间戳无法解析或超出允许的时效窗口。"

#: includes/Rest/Signing_Auth.php:295
msgid ""
"Regenerate the timestamp from a synced clock and re-sign the request before "
"retrying."
msgstr "重试前请使用已同步的时钟重新生成时间戳并重新签名请求。"

#: includes/Rest/Signing_Auth.php:304
msgid ""
"The signed content hash does not match the request body received by the "
"adapter."
msgstr "签名内容哈希与 Adapter 收到的请求体不匹配。"

#: includes/Rest/Signing_Auth.php:306
msgid ""
"Hash and sign the exact request body bytes; do not modify the body after "
"signing."
msgstr "请对确切的请求体字节做哈希与签名；签名后不要修改请求体。"

#: includes/Rest/Signing_Auth.php:328
msgid "The client key or request signature was rejected."
msgstr "客户端密钥或请求签名被拒绝。"

#: includes/Rest/Signing_Auth.php:330
msgid ""
"Pair the client again through POST /connect/device/start, or rebuild the "
"canonical string exactly as documented in docs/keypair-device-pairing-"
"contract.md and re-sign the request."
msgstr ""
"请通过 POST /connect/device/start 重新配对客户端，或严格按照 docs/keypair-"
"device-pairing-contract.md 的说明重建规范化字符串并重新签名请求。"

#: includes/Rest/Signing_Auth.php:338
msgid "The paired client key does not carry the scope required by this route."
msgstr "配对的客户端密钥不包含此路由所需的权限范围。"

#: includes/Rest/Signing_Auth.php:340
msgid ""
"Re-pair the client requesting the needed scope, or ask a WordPress "
"administrator to approve a key with it."
msgstr ""
"请以所需权限范围重新配对客户端，或请 WordPress 管理员批准包含该范围的密钥。"

#: includes/Rest/Signing_Auth.php:348
msgid "The signed request nonce was already claimed."
msgstr "签名请求的 nonce 已被使用。"

#: includes/Rest/Signing_Auth.php:350
msgid ""
"Use a fresh nonce for every request; a retried request must be re-signed "
"with a new nonce and timestamp."
msgstr "每个请求都使用新的 nonce；重试请求必须用新的 nonce 和时间戳重新签名。"

#: includes/Rest/Signing_Auth.php:622 includes/Rest/Signing_Auth.php:683
msgid "Device pairing was not found or expired."
msgstr "设备配对不存在或已过期。"

#: includes/Rest/Signing_Auth.php:797
msgid "Client key was not found for the current user."
msgstr "未找到当前用户的客户端密钥。"

#: includes/Rest/Signing_Auth.php:836
msgid "Too many device pairing attempts. Try again shortly."
msgstr "设备配对尝试次数过多。请稍后重试。"

#: includes/Rest/Signing_Auth.php:862
msgid "Too many device pairing polls. Try again shortly."
msgstr "设备配对轮询次数过多。请稍后重试。"

